{"2082530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Out Of Hell", "steam_appid": 2082530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Donovan Ling, a police officer and one of the last living souls in a city decimated by a demonic onslaught! Fight against relentless hordes of the undead, nightmarish horrors and hellish entities as you attempt to unravel the mysteries behind the invasion and escape with your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send the demonic dead back to Hell using 20+ tools of destruction! Utilize brutal melee weapons, firearms, explosives, and occult artifacts to cleave and burn your way through the zombie hordes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large and atmospheric levels including an abandoned police station, claustrophobic sewer, haunted forest and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the nightmarish darkness of Hell as you travel back and forth to retrieve powerful occult artifacts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and branching storyline with 3 different endings depending on your decisions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect skills during the Singleplayer campaign to use in &quot;Survival Mode&quot;, where you must fight through waves of demonic monstrosities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This is a remake of the Unreal Tournament 2004 mod of the same name by the same developer.)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Donovan Ling, a police officer and one of the last living souls in a city decimated by a demonic onslaught! Fight against relentless hordes of the undead, nightmarish horrors and hellish entities as you attempt to unravel the mysteries behind the invasion and escape with your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send the demoni